<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance comparison of dense (<span id="Sx4.T1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qwen2/2.5 0.5B</span>) and MoE models (upcycled from dense models) on in-distribution (ID) and out-of-distribution (OOD) data. The best and second-best results are <span id="Sx4.T1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span> and <span id="Sx4.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. “ANC” stands for anchor model.</figcaption>
</figure>
